{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年52歲的張玉珊（Shirley）早年憑清純玉女形象大受歡迎，淡出幕前後創辦美容纖體公司，2003年公司正式上市，當時年僅28歲的她更成為香港最年輕的上市公司主席，其後張玉珊將公司轉讓套現，有指她的身家已超過3億元，被譽為「商界女強人」！近年張玉珊積極投身慈善公益，日前適逢長者日，她在社交平台大曬與近兩百名長者同樂的照片，親民舉動獲網民大讚！</p><figure><img alt=\"張玉珊（Shirley）早年憑玉女形象大受歡迎。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250107/953330883358625792174328.jpeg/01rPiBBDJGk1nRkJV8Hn2hAJwASSm3BrRhHWUUYR1lE\"/><figcaption>張玉珊（Shirley）早年憑玉女形象大受歡迎。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"商界女強人！（IG@shirley_msc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092893227750789120936712.jpeg/JHzBLoOQ_3U4myVl_EP1DzFnpcCP62iLduk6B3bpOgc\"/><figcaption>商界女強人！（IG@shirley_msc）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人美心善。（IG@shirley_msc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250517/1000405084275740672350781.jpeg/zb9piLZZarF1onkG6eU3XSrJ4y7Kd7rWdkT85XZE_OU\"/><figcaption>人美心善。（IG@shirley_msc）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慶祝生日。（IG@shirley_msc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199787557672456192416738.jpeg/zDv064xxaOdTqYW4XGPqRQ_4kE3d3gMlyMws6MjMLOg\"/><figcaption>慶祝生日。（IG@shirley_msc）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中秋節派月餅。（IG@shirley_msc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251015/1055186087275663360490687.jpeg/_gVDKCkxgs5GG2t29qbwueC0je1AK9SY_JBcG_yQXBs\"/><figcaption>中秋節派月餅。（IG@shirley_msc）</figcaption></figure><p>張玉珊與180名公公婆婆過長者日　滿場飛敬茶親和力滿分</p><p>張玉珊在社交平台分享多張活動照，透露當日與多達180位長者一同慶祝長者日：「與180個公公婆婆慶祝長者日，They are so cute」從現場照片可見，活動在大型中式酒樓筵開十多席舉行，場面相當熱鬧。一眾公公婆婆桌上均放有茶點，每人手上更獲派發一封紅色利是，個個舉起利是對鏡頭笑得開懷。張玉珊在席間「滿場飛」，不但逐桌與長者舉杯「以茶代酒」敬茶問好，更俯身與婆婆面貼面自拍。當中有一名白髮婆婆特意拿出手機，向鏡頭展示與張玉珊的昔日自拍舊照，足見張玉珊多年來堅持探訪長者，默默行善，與長者建立深厚感情。</p><figure><img alt=\"張玉珊長者日宴請180名公公婆婆兼派利是。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199787383676473344271405.jpeg/bgCHzbBhtawUrcTVfT3eZSZQzG8doZOqKLRm6ii0Zuo\"/><figcaption>張玉珊長者日宴請180名公公婆婆兼派利是。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"張玉珊長者日宴請180名公公婆婆兼派利是。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199787380748718080316027.jpeg/L-kS9y-kCbZwNqVXRAGJT-z0vLPNQ1ZfvAyTQ7wMk0M\"/><figcaption>張玉珊長者日宴請180名公公婆婆兼派利是。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"善心爆棚。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199787378475274240125389.jpeg/8hXLpn22nvdDyf3ABP7cvmPtkqqHFEfZ5w5DYucOQ2I\"/><figcaption>善心爆棚。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"善心爆棚。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199787376260550656109573.jpeg/k8X79q7zQyQ5FMv_Opq7MxvjmA4gjCnx2tbDFtrWwxY\"/><figcaption>善心爆棚。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"昔日合照見證長年行善。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199787374062604288580619.jpeg/hHCtT0jZYWLElIBAQLXrIFrzMDSxvq8AHVUytR1VMrU\"/><figcaption>昔日合照見證長年行善。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>52歲張玉珊皮膚白滑美貌如昔　近年積極行善獲讚真女神</p><p>近年張玉珊鮮有公開露面，但保養得極好，一頭俐落短髮配上淡妝，皮膚白滑緊緻、眼神靈動，臉上幾乎不見歲月痕跡，與昔日玉女時期相比毫不遜色，獲網民激讚是「人美心善的真女神」！而張玉珊亦積極行善，她曾分享與富豪未婚夫盧啟賢（Calvin Lo）一起到懲教所探訪的照片，她更負責教授美容護膚，與在囚及更生人士互動，作風貼地毫無架子，更獲懲教署頒發「更生伙伴」殊榮！</p><figure><img alt=\"情人節收花！（IG@shirley_msc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260502/1127336465764716544693402.jpeg/fgyTGwobdLxZTl7veavMJKzWJDLrwFZCXYTOQl2EzkI\"/><figcaption>情人節收花！（IG@shirley_msc）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"張玉珊到懲教署探訪。（IG@shirley_msc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260716/1154479000945561600419630.jpeg/bYqbT4c5scyPtDq6nT1Wf5gqaO6WpCXHP0s4kj9LOJI\"/><figcaption>張玉珊到懲教署探訪。（IG@shirley_msc）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"張玉珊同富豪未婚夫盧啟賢一起到懲教所探訪。（IG@shirley_msc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251015/1055185148846804992432951.jpeg/kWOBrFldvy3myNOvDDeANf51n8cgVWLXeCuMjXgrjI0\"/><figcaption>張玉珊同富豪未婚夫盧啟賢一起到懲教所探訪。（IG@shirley_msc）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"教化妝護膚。（IG@shirley_msc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260716/1154479041194496000140532.jpeg/L_CnhQBc4BIIAaFlPlw3RUaXKQ2AuXMiTvv3tk7797Y\"/><figcaption>教化妝護膚。（IG@shirley_msc）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"獲懲教署頒發「更生伙伴」殊榮！（IG@shirley_msc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260716/1154479004733149184243106.jpeg/1l-mC_TxG7Elc3BJGo592wBDrFnRH6jmgl8O9IJfDvQ\"/><figcaption>獲懲教署頒發「更生伙伴」殊榮！（IG@shirley_msc）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"支持「共創明『Teen』計劃」。（IG@shirley_msc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260716/1154479036697939968317086.jpeg/CwVgUbrEebUV7sBWP54RHRSWWQtrztQ5exdT73sXU-8\"/><figcaption>支持「共創明『Teen』計劃」。（IG@shirley_msc）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"積極行善。（IG@shirley_msc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260716/1154479034688737280210983.jpeg/vTlIAZEUYf7DVjvSOlOP20vjYm91obmWtih8xrYofMY\"/><figcaption>積極行善。（IG@shirley_msc）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:43:55.406793+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1077,"images":17,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:30:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:37:26.063638+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:37:26.063638+00:00","content_hash":"8619eb269f0072d034fbb86356c0ec4b0a24add5ed2bd0b18167995a188cdfd3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}